---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const updated = '1 November 2026';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy | AR Medias" description="How AR Medias collects, uses and protects personal information submitted through armedias.com.">
  <article class="container-x max-w-3xl pb-24 pt-32 lg:pt-40">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="legal mt-10">
      <p>This policy explains how {site.legalName} ("we", "us") handles personal information collected through {site.url}.</p>

      <h2 data-no-split>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you use our contact form we collect the details you enter: name, email, phone number, company, country, the service you are interested in, budget range and your message, along with the date, the page you sent it from and your approximate country. Our hosting provider also records standard server logs such as IP address, browser type and pages requested.</p>

      <h2 data-no-split>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use your details only to reply to your enquiry, prepare proposals you request, and provide services you engage us for. We do not sell your personal information or use it for unrelated marketing without your consent.</p>

      <h2 data-no-split>Sharing</h2>
      <p>We share data only with service providers that help us operate, such as our hosting and email providers, and only as needed for those purposes, or where required by law.</p>

      <h2 data-no-split>Retention</h2>
      <p>We keep enquiry details for as long as needed to respond and to maintain records of our business relationship, then delete them.</p>

      <h2 data-no-split>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on where you live, including under India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, the EU/UK GDPR, the UAE PDPL, Canada's PIPEDA, Australia's Privacy Act, Japan's APPI, China's PIPL and US state laws, you may have the right to access, correct or delete your personal information, or withdraw consent. To make a request, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

      <h2 data-no-split>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>We do not use advertising or tracking cookies. To understand how the site is used, we count page views, the page visited, the referring website, the visitor's country and device type. Visitors are counted using a one-way code that changes every day and cannot be traced back to you; we do not store IP addresses for analytics. Our site is also served through Cloudflare, which processes technical data to deliver and protect the site.</p>

      <h2 data-no-split>Contact</h2>
      <p>{site.legalName}, {site.address.street}, {site.address.locality}, {site.address.countryName}. Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. Phone: {site.phone}.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal :global(h2) { margin-top: 2.5rem; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .legal p { margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-slate); }
  .legal a { color: var(--color-olive); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
